# Don't run dependencies' install scripts.
# npm 11 forgets better-sqlite3's "gypfile": false when installing from package-lock.json and
# tries to compile it with node-gyp, which needs Visual Studio on Windows. Nothing here needs
# that: better-sqlite3 ships prebuilt Node-API binaries that work in Node and Electron, and
# Electron downloads its own binary the first time it's used. `npm test` and `npm run <script>`
# still work. Check with: npm run check:native
ignore-scripts=true
